  - id: levites_portion
    displayName: Levites' Portion
    flavorText: Forty-eight cities with pasture lands, since the Levites received
      no land inheritance of their own.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Assigns the Levites forty-eight cities with surrounding pasture lands
      out of the other tribes' inheritances, since the Levites received no territorial
      inheritance of their own - teaching that the priestly calling is itself their
      portion, with the LORD as their inheritance, while still providing practically
      for their material needs.
    deliveredByManagerId: joshua
